Thumbs.db

# The creature models are the project's own and are committed, through LFS.
#
# What stays out is the tile pack: `brawl_arena/` is two Unity Asset Store packs,
# and the `.meshlib` is built from them and is therefore derived from them. A
# licence to use an asset in a game is not a licence to redistribute the asset,
# and a repository redistributes. The maps painted with it still work for a
# clone — a `GridMap` keeps its cells with no library at all, so the world stays
# walkable and turns invisible.
/game/assets/species/brawl_arena/
/game/assets/species/brawl_arena.meshlib
